# Vauxhall Velox and Cresta PB saloon, 1962-1965.
#
# The PB: the squarer, longer body that replaced the finned PA, with the
# flat rear deck and the wider track. The Velox and Cresta shared the shell;
# one object represents it.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vauxhall_Cresta
#
# Dimensions: 4,616 x 1,784 x 1,440 mm, wheelbase 2,730 mm (Cresta figures;
# the Velox height was not stated and the Cresta is complete).
#
# Shape reference: image 1 is a true level side profile; the flank is traced
# from it.
#
# Colours: grade (d); no period Vauxhall colour list was found. Black, Grey,
# Blue and Green are plain period names. Weights 12, 10, 9, 8, total 39,
# provisional.
#
# Speed 145 km/h. Comfort 55/413, on the line 330 + 1.5 x 55. Classes 1,2,3.
# Dates: intro October 1962; retires staggered 1976-1979 as a road tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vauxhall-velox-cresta-pb.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/vauxhall-velox-cresta-pb.dae. References:
# citycars/references/vauxhall-velox-cresta-pb/ (gitignored).
#
# Accepted deviations: one shared saloon with the pre-October 1964 front. The
# later full-width grille is not represented.


obj=citycar
name=VauxhallVeloxCrestaPB(Black)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=12
intro_year=1962
intro_month=10
retire_year=1979
retire_month=6
speed=145
class=1,2,3
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=55
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=413

